{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The Breeze feels like a natural follow-up to Old Sock because I want more Clapton and relaxed blues guitar.",
    "Blue & Lonesome connects with the blues side of my Hendrix and Clapton listening, while the country and roots choices also fit part of my recent interests."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The Sinatra collection misses my current interest in guitar-driven blues, rock, and country; familiar older music alone is not enough to interest me.",
    "I cannot connect Retrospective to my listening because I do not know whose music it contains; that uncertainty keeps me from choosing it."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "The Sinatra choice makes it seem as though enjoying established rock and blues musicians means I want any classic performer.",
    "Large career collections seem to receive more emphasis than my immediate desire to hear a particular album or sound."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "The direct connection to Old Sock matters more to me today than a broad resemblance to my overall listening history.",
    "I choose only a couple of albums at a time, so saving a relevant country or roots album for later does not mean I dislike that music."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations mostly understand my blues and roots interests, but sometimes stretch familiarity too broadly and miss what I am ready to hear today."
}"}
